{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde8 <strong>Inspired by classic evolution battle games</strong>, <i>Sparkfront: Online</i> throws players into chaotic 1v1 battles where armies evolve across ages, towers fall, and strategy constantly shifts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're laughing over voice chat or locked in sweaty battles, every match is a fast, chaotic race to crush your opponent\u2019s tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Fight through three unique ages:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/extras/bases_gif.gif?t=1751477586\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 <strong>The Primitive Age</strong> (clubs, spears, raw chaos)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 <strong>The Middle Age</strong> (knights, armor, steel clashes)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 <strong>The Green Age</strong> (90s-style camo and modern warfare)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/extras/soldiers_in_queue_gif.gif?t=1751477586\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaf Loot drops from defeated enemies add tactical depth \u2014 stackable or single-use items that change the flow of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/extras/inventory_50_gif.gif?t=1751477586\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 Shape your path with stat upgrades unlocked at every age \u2014 boost movement speed, turret damage, economy, or item drop rates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/extras/stats_final.gif?t=1751477586\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf81 Unpredictable Dropbox events spice up each match with sudden XP boosts, extra income, or short bursts of <strong>Frenzy Mode</strong> \u2014 rapid-fire, cost-free unit spam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/extras/drop_box_50.gif?t=1751477586\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddf1 <i>Sparkfront</i> blends real-time strategy, era-based progression, and tower defense into a compact PvP showdown that rewards timing, adaptation, and all-out aggression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3737860?t=1751477586","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3737860?t=1751477586","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/d51566c8ce02256b5f2974007dc2ecc93d239cc1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751477586","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/d51566c8ce02256b5f2974007dc2ecc93d239cc1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751477586","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde8 <strong>Inspired by classic evolution battle games</strong>, <i>Sparkfront: Online</i> throws players into chaotic 1v1 battles where armies evolve across ages, towers fall, and strategy constantly shifts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're laughing over voice chat or locked in sweaty battles, every match is a fast, chaotic race to crush your opponent\u2019s tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Fight through three unique ages:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/extras/bases_gif.gif?t=1751477586\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 <strong>The Primitive Age</strong> (clubs, spears, raw chaos)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 <strong>The Middle Age</strong> (knights, armor, steel clashes)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 <strong>The Green Age</strong> (90s-style camo and modern warfare)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/extras/soldiers_in_queue_gif.gif?t=1751477586\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaf Loot drops from defeated enemies add tactical depth \u2014 stackable or single-use items that change the flow of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/extras/inventory_50_gif.gif?t=1751477586\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 Shape your path with stat upgrades unlocked at every age \u2014 boost movement speed, turret damage, economy, or item drop rates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/extras/stats_final.gif?t=1751477586\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf81 Unpredictable Dropbox events spice up each match with sudden XP boosts, extra income, or short bursts of <strong>Frenzy Mode</strong> \u2014 rapid-fire, cost-free unit spam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/extras/drop_box_50.gif?t=1751477586\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddf1 <i>Sparkfront</i> blends real-time strategy, era-based progression, and tower defense into a compact PvP showdown that rewards timing, adaptation, and all-out aggression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Sel\u00e7uk Oru\u00e7"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737860/90ceaf83a184b1f0963fb4bb92022dfa3cb56784/header.jpg?t=1751477586","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257154884,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154884/movie480.mp4?t=1749852125","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154884/movie_max.mp4?t=1749852125"},"name":"Intro Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257154884/12d5b483276343f7032af6eaaa4ecaa0951b6fbd/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749852125","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154884/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749852125","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154884/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749852125"}}],"name":"Sparkfront: Online","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Pentium<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3 or equivalen